// Ikon generik (bebas-tool), nama diverifikasi docs.eraser.io/docs/icons 2026-07-11.
// Rendering WAJIB horizontal (direction right), tanpa \rotatebox pada LaTeX.

direction right

// Sumber (batas)
Sumber Data Eksternal [icon: cloud, color: gray, label: "Sumber Data Eksternal (API, berkas, basis data)"]

Data Ingestion and Processing Layer [icon: download, color: orange] {
  data collection [icon: download]
  data ingestion [icon: inbox]
  data cleaning [icon: filter]
  data preprocessor [icon: cog]
}

// Tujuan hilir (batas)
Data Storage Layer [icon: database, color: green, label: "Data Storage Layer"]
Data Governance Layer [icon: book, color: teal, label: "Data Governance Layer"]

// Rantai kurasi data kiri ke kanan (munappy2020adhoc, amershi2019software)
Sumber Data Eksternal > data collection: ekstraksi sumber
data collection > data ingestion: data mentah terkumpul
data ingestion > data cleaning: pembersihan
data cleaning > data preprocessor: praolah

// Keluaran pipeline (najafabadi2024analysis, munappy2020adhoc)
data preprocessor > Data Storage Layer: data terkelola
data preprocessor > Data Governance Layer: hasil praolah divalidasi
